                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/releases/tag/untagged-ba220eb6b8235989a129"&gt;v0.3.333&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h3&gt;Feature Improvements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Smarter COM marshalling (&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1771" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1771/hovercard"&gt;#1771&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/strong&gt; CsWin32 now automatically marshals recognized COM outputs as WinRT objects when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simpler IID/PPV calls (&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1720" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1720/hovercard"&gt;#1720&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/strong&gt; IID and &lt;code&gt;void**&lt;/code&gt; parameter pairs now produce generic &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; overloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="shellItem.BindToHandler(pbc, in bhid, typeof(IStream).GUID, out object result);
IStream stream = (IStream)result;"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;shellItem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-en"&gt;BindToHandler&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;pbc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;bhid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;typeof&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;IStream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;GUID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;out&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;object&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;IStream&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;stream&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;IStream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="shellItem.BindToHandler&amp;lt;IStream&amp;gt;(pbc, in bhid, out IStream stream);"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;shellItem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;BindToHandler&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;IStream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;pbc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;bhid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;out&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;IStream&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;stream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CsWin32 supplies the IID and returns the strongly typed interface directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes:&lt;/h3&gt;
